WEBVTT

00:00:17.750 --> 00:00:19.780
Ah! My Goddess
Flights of Fancy

00:00:19.780 --> 00:00:23.310
In this wide world

00:00:24.620 --> 00:00:28.490
People you're meant to meet can be seen

00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:35.060
Beyond the window, beyond the rainbow

00:00:35.060 --> 00:00:38.690
I think you're aware of them

00:00:40.870 --> 00:00:45.810
Take off that restrictive weight

00:00:45.810 --> 00:00:48.780
Let your feelings go

00:00:48.780 --> 00:00:56.090
Now keep your ears open and wait for that time

00:00:56.090 --> 00:00:58.850
Awaken now

00:01:00.020 --> 00:01:12.130
Cherish the little dream you've
drawn in the vast sky

00:01:12.130 --> 00:01:19.410
If you do, you can always become happy

00:01:19.410 --> 00:01:22.180
It's certain

00:01:22.180 --> 00:01:26.550
Woh woh

00:01:34.360 --> 00:01:37.720
You almost had them, Marlie...

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:40.690
But as always, you lost it towards the end.

00:01:42.630 --> 00:01:45.790
Now then, where will we go from here?

00:01:46.170 --> 00:01:52.110
Ah! The Chair of Demonkind Descends!

00:01:52.540 --> 00:01:55.010
Do you not see this head of mine?!

00:01:55.010 --> 00:01:58.310
Your head... Are you the Renegade Priest?!

00:01:58.310 --> 00:02:00.370
Oh, hell, I don't care! Get 'em, boys!

00:02:02.990 --> 00:02:05.010
I shall punish you on behalf of great Buddha!

00:02:06.860 --> 00:02:09.330
What magnificent singing!

00:02:09.330 --> 00:02:11.190
It just washes over my heart!

00:02:11.790 --> 00:02:13.850
Yeah! Take 'em all down!

00:02:14.060 --> 00:02:16.930
That kind of uncivilized behavior
is no good at all.

00:02:16.930 --> 00:02:18.930
We must place the greatest value on love.

00:02:18.930 --> 00:02:22.200
Love is somethin' you gotta
win through combat!

00:02:22.640 --> 00:02:25.910
It kind of seems as though we've
got one more Urd now.

00:02:25.910 --> 00:02:29.150
Oh, jeez, you're always so easygoing
with things, Big Sister!

00:02:29.150 --> 00:02:30.910
And if she keeps on switching back
and forth like that so much,

00:02:30.910 --> 00:02:31.350
Oh, hell! This thing's been acting up
too much lately!
And if she keeps on switching back
and forth like that so much,

00:02:31.350 --> 00:02:33.480
Oh, hell! This thing's been acting up
too much lately!
It'll be a nightmare trying to
keep up with her.

00:02:33.480 --> 00:02:34.680
Hey, do something!

00:02:38.420 --> 00:02:41.250
What are you staring at me for?

00:02:41.720 --> 00:02:47.230
Uh, fix this TV, will you?
Uh, Sk... Sku... Tiny.

00:02:47.230 --> 00:02:49.430
WHO YOU CALLIN' TINY?!

00:02:49.430 --> 00:02:49.900
And why are you sounding out
my name like you don't know it?!

00:02:49.900 --> 00:02:52.400
Sk...
And why are you sounding out
my name like you don't know it?!

00:02:52.400 --> 00:02:53.970
Sku...

00:02:53.970 --> 00:02:55.940
Skuld! Yeah...

00:02:55.940 --> 00:02:57.710
What's the matter with you?

00:02:57.710 --> 00:03:00.330
Uh, nothing, nothing at all!

00:03:00.610 --> 00:03:03.550
Hey, by the way, wasn't Marller
going to find some information

00:03:03.550 --> 00:03:05.920
on that "heretical pot" she used on Urd?

00:03:05.920 --> 00:03:07.280
Belldandy?

00:03:09.550 --> 00:03:11.920
Uh, what was the explosion and
whose scream was that?

00:03:11.920 --> 00:03:15.520
I forgot to keep Banpei's safety on...

00:03:17.860 --> 00:03:19.860
That totally sucked!

00:03:19.860 --> 00:03:23.320
It was all your fault to begin with,
so don't go crying about it!

00:03:23.530 --> 00:03:25.830
So were you able to find anything out?

00:03:26.800 --> 00:03:29.610
Well, that vase got mixed up in a
mail order that I had placed,

00:03:29.610 --> 00:03:31.840
so the original sender and its
origin are both unknown...

00:03:31.840 --> 00:03:34.470
So trying to track it didn't get me anywhere...

00:03:34.980 --> 00:03:38.480
What the heck made you use some
random item like that anyway?!

00:03:38.480 --> 00:03:42.750
Whoa, wait a minute! It's not like
I haven't given this any thought.

00:03:42.750 --> 00:03:44.750
Then what's your thinking?

00:03:44.750 --> 00:03:46.490
Putting where it came from aside,

00:03:46.490 --> 00:03:50.120
that heretical pot has got to be
something straight outta legend.

00:03:50.660 --> 00:03:54.790
Frankly, it's not something a First Class goddess
or demon could just go messing around with.

00:03:55.300 --> 00:03:57.100
On the other hand, if we were
talking about something

00:03:57.100 --> 00:03:59.400
even greater than a First Class goddess
or demon, then maybe...

00:03:59.400 --> 00:04:01.370
Y-You don't mean...

00:04:01.600 --> 00:04:04.210
Something greater than us.

00:04:04.210 --> 00:04:06.000
The Almighty in other words?

00:04:06.340 --> 00:04:10.070
Or maybe the... the ruler of demonkind...

00:04:12.920 --> 00:04:14.820
Who's the ruler of demonkind?

00:04:14.820 --> 00:04:18.620
Don't go saying the name of
our ruler in vain, human!

00:04:18.920 --> 00:04:21.920
The ruler of demonkind is our head honcho,
the ultimate authority of all demonkind!

00:04:21.920 --> 00:04:23.980
It's our equivalent of Heaven's Almighty One!

00:04:24.960 --> 00:04:26.260
Urd...

00:04:40.580 --> 00:04:42.740
T... Tr... Trou-ba...

00:05:02.670 --> 00:05:06.000
What's this? I'm surprised to
see you out here all alone.

00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:08.670
Who were you, now?

00:05:09.770 --> 00:05:12.100
Well, I see you're your old, sarcastic self!

00:05:12.810 --> 00:05:17.380
You may have beaten me last year,
but this year there's no way I'll lose!

00:05:17.380 --> 00:05:18.850
And don't you forget it!

00:05:19.650 --> 00:05:23.610
That Sayoko really is one energetic girl!

00:05:23.850 --> 00:05:27.190
Ah! SAYOKO, that's it! That's Sayoko!

00:05:27.190 --> 00:05:30.520
She was a lot of fun to hang out with...

00:05:32.460 --> 00:05:33.900
AUTO CLUB

00:05:33.900 --> 00:05:35.930
AUTO CLUB
Oh, well if it isn't Urd!

00:05:35.930 --> 00:05:37.730
AUTO CLUB
What brings you here?

00:05:38.070 --> 00:05:39.930
Uh, umm...

00:05:40.340 --> 00:05:44.200
Oh, I just happened to be passing by.
Hi there, Mr. Tamiya, Mr. Otaki.

00:05:44.540 --> 00:05:46.610
MISTER Tamiya?!

00:05:46.610 --> 00:05:48.580
MISTER Otaki?!

00:05:48.880 --> 00:05:50.980
I'll go get a doctor right away!

00:05:50.980 --> 00:05:51.080
Huh?
I'll go get a doctor right away!

00:05:51.080 --> 00:05:51.980
Huh?
You just take it easy, we'll be right back!

00:05:51.980 --> 00:05:53.510
You just take it easy, we'll be right back!

00:05:55.320 --> 00:05:58.120
I have some good friends, don't I?

00:05:58.820 --> 00:06:00.580
Heh... Yeah.

00:06:08.600 --> 00:06:12.270
It was a sunset just like this when
I was here with him, wasn't it?

00:06:12.270 --> 00:06:13.670
Him?

00:06:14.540 --> 00:06:17.770
Have you forgotten about Shohei, too?

00:06:18.240 --> 00:06:20.730
Oh, right! Shohei!

00:06:21.910 --> 00:06:24.250
Well, I guess it's about time...

00:06:24.250 --> 00:06:26.780
I'll count on you to take care of the rest.

00:06:26.780 --> 00:06:28.680
Are you sure about this?

00:06:28.680 --> 00:06:32.620
Your soul is being drawn steadily
towards the divine!

00:06:32.620 --> 00:06:34.060
At this rate...

00:06:34.060 --> 00:06:36.130
I'll cease to be.

00:06:36.130 --> 00:06:40.080
And with the demonic side gone,
a new goddess will be born.

00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:41.860
It sounds great, right?

00:06:42.560 --> 00:06:47.340
Abandoning all the memories of the days
we spent as a hybrid goddess/demon,

00:06:47.340 --> 00:06:50.110
all the people we met,
and the bonds we made?

00:06:50.110 --> 00:06:51.710
Well, it's just...

00:06:51.710 --> 00:06:55.580
Tell me the truth. You are afraid, right?

00:06:55.780 --> 00:06:58.080
Of losing all these memories...

00:06:58.080 --> 00:07:02.480
and especially of losing the
special bond you have with...

00:07:06.720 --> 00:07:09.590
Kinda funny to say this to myself,
but I guess I have a bad personality.

00:07:09.590 --> 00:07:12.220
But I AM you, you know.

00:07:14.800 --> 00:07:16.670
Is that true?!

00:07:16.670 --> 00:07:22.240
Yes. At this rate, the demonic side
of Urd will disappear completely.

00:07:22.240 --> 00:07:23.570
No way!

00:07:23.570 --> 00:07:26.210
What makes you so sure of that?

00:07:26.210 --> 00:07:29.210
Remember what Urd was like earlier?

00:07:29.210 --> 00:07:30.840
What she was like earlier?

00:07:33.520 --> 00:07:37.280
Yes, the memories of her
demonic side are disappearing.

00:07:37.890 --> 00:07:41.860
That means Urd's going to become
100% goddess, doesn't it?

00:07:41.860 --> 00:07:44.430
Is there something wrong with that?

00:07:44.430 --> 00:07:45.960
Well...

00:07:45.960 --> 00:07:49.200
It just means the end of some dumb
goddess, who'd actually hang out

00:07:49.200 --> 00:07:53.270
all buddy-buddy with mean-spirited, flakey,
thoughtless demons! No biggie!

00:07:53.270 --> 00:07:54.670
Don't say that!

00:07:54.670 --> 00:07:56.570
I don't want that!

00:07:56.570 --> 00:07:59.270
If Urd becomes like Big Sister,
I won't have anyone to fight with!

00:07:59.270 --> 00:08:01.910
I don't want that to happen at all!

00:08:01.910 --> 00:08:02.780
Skuld...
I don't want that to happen at all!

00:08:02.780 --> 00:08:03.040
Skuld...

00:08:03.450 --> 00:08:05.850
Isn't there anything we can do?

00:08:05.850 --> 00:08:09.340
Can't we ask the Almighty for help,
like you were saying earlier?

00:08:10.850 --> 00:08:14.490
The Almighty would probably
be able to restore

00:08:14.490 --> 00:08:19.290
Urd's split goddess program to
its original state. But...

00:08:19.290 --> 00:08:23.630
It's more likely the Almighty would take this
opportunity to rewrite Urd's program

00:08:23.630 --> 00:08:25.860
as a full goddess instead.

00:08:26.400 --> 00:08:28.200
So there's no recourse...

00:08:29.510 --> 00:08:32.840
Sheesh, have you guys already
forgotten what I told you?

00:08:33.810 --> 00:08:36.350
Honestly, I'm real reluctant to say it, though...

00:08:36.350 --> 00:08:38.540
There's just one option.

00:08:38.750 --> 00:08:40.150
Urd!

00:08:40.150 --> 00:08:43.820
Like Marller says, there's just one person

00:08:43.820 --> 00:08:46.360
who has power equal to the Almighty,
and who might be willing

00:08:46.360 --> 00:08:49.550
to work out some kind of deal,
depending on how we approach her...

00:08:49.930 --> 00:08:52.660
Yeah, She could probably...

00:08:52.660 --> 00:08:53.860
"She"?

00:08:55.630 --> 00:08:58.160
The ruler of demonkind, Hild.

00:09:03.910 --> 00:09:06.640
This is our answer.

00:09:06.640 --> 00:09:09.950
The other me says she does
not want to forget...

00:09:09.950 --> 00:09:12.380
She doesn't want to lose the memories
of being half-demon, half-goddess,

00:09:12.380 --> 00:09:14.380
and especially not the memories
of that person...

00:09:14.380 --> 00:09:17.610
I want to respect her wishes.

00:09:18.150 --> 00:09:20.390
Do you think that would make me
a failure as a goddess?

00:09:20.390 --> 00:09:21.410
No.

00:09:22.620 --> 00:09:24.990
Then I'll leave this to you.

00:09:24.990 --> 00:09:29.520
If I stay concealed, it will at temporarily halt
the progression towards full divinity.

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:32.230
I appreciate it.

00:09:32.230 --> 00:09:34.930
All right then, I'll go call her.

00:09:45.880 --> 00:09:47.250
Okay then.

00:09:48.020 --> 00:09:50.750
So it's really that easy to call her?

00:09:50.750 --> 00:09:52.390
I've got no clue!

00:09:52.390 --> 00:09:54.920
What are you so freaked out over?

00:09:54.920 --> 00:09:58.720
Sh-Shut up! It must be nice
not having any clue!

00:10:03.800 --> 00:10:07.170
Hello? Yeah... it has been a while.

00:10:08.040 --> 00:10:10.270
Actually, this may be the first time
for me to call you first.

00:10:10.470 --> 00:10:12.040
They're... friends?

00:10:12.040 --> 00:10:15.130
No, I don't think it's quite like that.
Most likely...

00:10:16.380 --> 00:10:18.870
You must know about what's happened, right?

00:10:19.450 --> 00:10:22.320
Come on, don't play dumb. I KNOW you know!

00:10:23.850 --> 00:10:25.090
WHAT?!

00:10:25.090 --> 00:10:27.920
N-Now, just wait a minute!
No, we're not ready to...

00:10:27.920 --> 00:10:29.390
Hello?!

00:10:29.660 --> 00:10:31.130
What happened?

00:10:32.490 --> 00:10:34.460
She said she's coming over. Now.

00:10:34.660 --> 00:10:37.560
What?! You got the ruler of demonkind
to come here, just like that?!

00:10:39.300 --> 00:10:40.430
Yup...

00:10:41.900 --> 00:10:44.670
I mean, she IS my mother, after all.

00:11:01.760 --> 00:11:02.950
Incredible...

00:11:04.260 --> 00:11:05.690
She's here.

00:11:23.510 --> 00:11:25.980
That's Urd's...

00:11:30.890 --> 00:11:35.220
Oh, Urd, darling! It's been SO long!

00:11:35.220 --> 00:11:38.260
Couldn't you have shown up a less LOUDLY?

00:11:38.260 --> 00:11:42.030
Oh, my. But I was holding back
as much as I could!

00:11:42.030 --> 00:11:46.400
After all, I'd normally blow a little
town like this away, no sweat!

00:11:46.740 --> 00:11:48.740
Is she really all that incredible?

00:11:48.740 --> 00:11:54.010
Yes. All the jewelry on her hair and
arms probably seals her powers.

00:11:54.010 --> 00:11:55.010
What?!

00:11:55.010 --> 00:11:58.010
If that's the case, then her true power must...

00:11:58.010 --> 00:12:00.000
So you're Belldandy?

00:12:01.220 --> 00:12:03.510
And you must be Skuld?

00:12:03.850 --> 00:12:05.150
Yes...

00:12:06.720 --> 00:12:08.920
You look JUST like him!

00:12:09.620 --> 00:12:12.680
Hild... Urd's mother...

00:12:13.630 --> 00:12:16.320
Is this really the head honcho
of all demonkind?

00:12:17.500 --> 00:12:19.590
It's nice to meet you, Hild.

00:12:19.970 --> 00:12:22.100
And YOU'RE Morisato Keiichi, aren't you?

00:12:22.100 --> 00:12:22.640
Eh, I, uh... Well...
And YOU'RE Morisato Keiichi, aren't you?

00:12:22.640 --> 00:12:25.040
Eh, I, uh... Well...
She's just like Urd with how she
doesn't even listen to you...

00:12:25.040 --> 00:12:25.470
She's just like Urd with how she
doesn't even listen to you...

00:12:25.470 --> 00:12:27.140
Well, not really, though.

00:12:27.840 --> 00:12:30.680
I like guys like you!

00:12:30.680 --> 00:12:35.140
Now, what sort of desires lie behind
those unassuming eyes of yours?

00:12:37.950 --> 00:12:39.920
I would just love to find out.

00:12:43.460 --> 00:12:48.100
So... How about you give me the
full story on why I've come here?

00:12:48.100 --> 00:12:51.000
Oh, and no running away now, Marlie.

00:12:52.230 --> 00:12:55.800
P-Perish the thought, Lady Hild!
Running away!

00:13:15.760 --> 00:13:18.190
Fusing a goddess and a demon, huh?

00:13:18.190 --> 00:13:21.100
Well, true there's nothing I cannot do,
but it would be a pain...

00:13:21.100 --> 00:13:24.100
and besides, isn't this is a good
opportunity to choose just one?

00:13:24.100 --> 00:13:25.900
I have no such intentions.

00:13:25.900 --> 00:13:30.310
I am half-goddess, half-demon. Anything other
than that, and I wouldn't be me anymore.

00:13:30.310 --> 00:13:32.310
I don't mind returning you to how you were,

00:13:32.310 --> 00:13:35.940
but what if I had you come back to
the demon realm once I've done it?

00:13:36.480 --> 00:13:38.410
I thought you might say that.

00:13:38.410 --> 00:13:42.710
Even if I am half demonic,
I'm still a goddess.

00:13:43.050 --> 00:13:45.650
And I take pride in that.

00:13:46.020 --> 00:13:49.820
So that is one thing I cannot
agree to... no matter what.

00:13:53.660 --> 00:13:57.100
Are you in a position to set terms anyway?

00:13:57.100 --> 00:14:00.870
That weird thing from the demon realm
caused this in the first place! You're...

00:14:00.870 --> 00:14:02.170
...to blame?

00:14:03.100 --> 00:14:06.310
Even if that item does have something
to do with the demon realm,

00:14:06.310 --> 00:14:08.010
what problem do you have with it?

00:14:08.010 --> 00:14:10.210
With the exception of killing each other,

00:14:10.210 --> 00:14:14.480
anything goes in the battle
between gods and demons.

00:14:14.480 --> 00:14:17.650
Meaning that I hold absolutely
no responsibility in this matter.

00:14:17.650 --> 00:14:22.290
Wouldn't you say you're in fact the
one to be blamed for this situation,

00:14:22.290 --> 00:14:25.590
for fusing Urd back together using
that poorly built contraption?

00:14:25.730 --> 00:14:28.060
But since it was my dearest
daughter making the request,

00:14:28.060 --> 00:14:32.260
I thought maybe I'd help her...
under a few little terms.

00:14:32.700 --> 00:14:35.170
You think you could you go a little
easier on my little sister?

00:14:35.800 --> 00:14:38.210
This is what I'd expect of
the ruler of demonkind,

00:14:38.210 --> 00:14:40.670
being able to freeze someone in their
tracks with a single glance...

00:14:41.040 --> 00:14:45.000
Okay, let's do this: We'll forget about
Urd coming back with me.

00:14:45.380 --> 00:14:46.900
Instead...

00:14:47.420 --> 00:14:51.780
What do you say about granting
ME a little wish?

00:14:52.250 --> 00:14:54.360
What kind of wish?

00:14:54.360 --> 00:14:55.980
That's a secret.

00:14:56.390 --> 00:15:00.050
But if you turn around and say to come
with you, she can't refuse then!

00:15:10.470 --> 00:15:14.270
Not bad... But that was your
full power just now, wasn't it?

00:15:14.610 --> 00:15:16.910
Would you care to try again?

00:15:21.580 --> 00:15:23.590
Heh... I yield.

00:15:23.590 --> 00:15:26.050
Since you look as though you could
go beyond your full power.

00:15:29.290 --> 00:15:30.320
Well, then...

00:15:34.300 --> 00:15:38.360
Keiichi, I'm afraid we can't have you
underestimating us demons, now.

00:15:38.930 --> 00:15:41.400
This will be a formal contract, you see.

00:15:41.400 --> 00:15:44.970
We demons make VERY sure
we honor our contracts.

00:15:44.970 --> 00:15:48.880
Y-You're saying that trust is
essential in doing business?

00:15:48.880 --> 00:15:51.870
Exactly! Oh, I just love intelligent boys!

00:15:52.450 --> 00:15:58.120
We will take anyone's wishes, so long
as we are compensated in full.

00:15:58.120 --> 00:16:00.140
If one desires the destruction of this world...

00:16:01.090 --> 00:16:02.590
well, even that's not out of the question.

00:16:02.590 --> 00:16:03.760
No way!

00:16:03.760 --> 00:16:06.560
Of course, what we grant is proportional
to what's offered in return,

00:16:06.560 --> 00:16:08.860
so I think that may be a bit much.

00:16:09.060 --> 00:16:13.900
But, as long as something is given
in return, we'd do it any time.

00:16:18.040 --> 00:16:19.940
Went off on a tangent there, huh?

00:16:19.940 --> 00:16:22.240
So then, what will you do, Urd?

00:16:22.240 --> 00:16:27.150
Fine. As long as whatever it is won't
damage my pride as a goddess.

00:16:27.480 --> 00:16:29.550
Oh, my, I'd never!

00:16:29.550 --> 00:16:31.390
I swear to the Almighty.

00:16:31.390 --> 00:16:33.650
Now THAT is something I can't believe!

00:16:36.190 --> 00:16:38.760
Can we trust her?

00:16:38.760 --> 00:16:41.100
I think it will be fine.

00:16:41.100 --> 00:16:45.270
Demons take contracts very
seriously, and besides...

00:16:45.270 --> 00:16:46.370
Besides?

00:16:46.370 --> 00:16:47.840
Hey, Bell?

00:16:48.940 --> 00:16:50.610
C'mere a sec!

00:16:50.610 --> 00:16:51.800
Coming!

00:16:53.840 --> 00:16:55.180
Yes, what is it?

00:16:55.180 --> 00:16:58.310
That Keiichi's quite a guy, isn't he?

00:16:58.310 --> 00:17:02.720
There aren't too many who can stand up and
say how they feel to the ruler of demonkind!

00:17:04.720 --> 00:17:07.260
Would you give him over to me?

00:17:07.260 --> 00:17:08.720
No way.

00:17:09.460 --> 00:17:12.360
Well now, you're more straightforward
than you look, aren't you?

00:17:12.360 --> 00:17:15.060
Hild, may I ask you a question?

00:17:15.060 --> 00:17:18.070
What? About why we split up?

00:17:18.070 --> 00:17:22.230
Not that... Why did you wait
for the phone call?

00:17:22.600 --> 00:17:24.770
It's not like I was waiting...

00:17:24.770 --> 00:17:28.870
Is that right? Well, I guess
that's all right, too.

00:17:30.380 --> 00:17:33.250
You really are just like him.

00:17:33.520 --> 00:17:36.210
I always hated that part of him.

00:17:36.750 --> 00:17:42.190
Well, this is best for Urd and me...

00:17:42.790 --> 00:17:44.930
Do you think so?

00:17:44.930 --> 00:17:46.220
I do.

00:17:49.460 --> 00:17:53.230
Hey, Urd? Do you hate your mother?

00:17:53.700 --> 00:17:56.760
Well, it's not exactly a matter of
whether I love her or hate her...

00:17:56.970 --> 00:17:59.270
Well, shall we begin?

00:18:09.450 --> 00:18:12.850
I hate to admit it, but she's a sight to behold.

00:18:13.290 --> 00:18:16.120
Raising such an incredible magical
field in the blink of an eye...

00:18:16.590 --> 00:18:20.030
Please! You can't go being impressed
by a little old thing like this!

00:18:20.030 --> 00:18:24.030
After all, you'll be doing all the work from here.

00:18:24.030 --> 00:18:25.400
Work?

00:18:25.400 --> 00:18:28.940
You think I'm going to chant
all 512 verses on my own?

00:18:28.940 --> 00:18:31.440
You've gotta help me out with the divine parts!

00:18:31.440 --> 00:18:32.310
Huh?!

00:18:32.310 --> 00:18:35.710
It can't be. Don't tell me you can't do it!

00:18:35.710 --> 00:18:38.610
Daughter of the one and only
ruler of demonkind,

00:18:38.610 --> 00:18:41.950
and you can't even help out with
the divine part of the circle!

00:18:41.950 --> 00:18:43.450
Oh, Almighty above!

00:18:43.450 --> 00:18:44.290
All right, I'll do it! Just cut that out, will you?
Oh, Almighty above!

00:18:44.290 --> 00:18:46.310
All right, I'll do it! Just cut that out, will you?

00:18:52.490 --> 00:18:53.720
Skuld?

00:18:55.100 --> 00:18:56.560
Belldandy, you, too?

00:18:56.800 --> 00:18:59.360
Let us help you, Urd.

00:19:00.570 --> 00:19:02.260
You two...

00:19:04.770 --> 00:19:06.430
Okay, let's give this a shot.

00:19:27.400 --> 00:19:29.630
Good, good, that's the way...

00:19:30.430 --> 00:19:33.230
Damn, I can't keep up with this divine part!

00:19:45.210 --> 00:19:47.550
This was worth doing after all.

00:20:18.650 --> 00:20:21.210
Welcome back, me.

00:20:22.080 --> 00:20:23.820
Well, now.

00:20:23.820 --> 00:20:27.190
Now, will you hear MY wish?

00:20:27.190 --> 00:20:28.920
All right.

00:20:30.120 --> 00:20:32.190
Call me "Mom"!

00:20:32.190 --> 00:20:33.490
No way.

00:20:37.530 --> 00:20:39.630
I'm gonna turn you right back
to the way you were!

00:20:39.630 --> 00:20:42.070
Urd! You do understand, don't you?

00:20:42.740 --> 00:20:44.970
How Hild feels about you?

00:20:44.970 --> 00:20:47.410
Yeah, I know all that.

00:20:47.410 --> 00:20:48.480
Then...

00:20:48.480 --> 00:20:49.770
I don't think so.

00:20:50.040 --> 00:20:53.410
That is exactly why I can't have
any love for my mother.

00:20:53.650 --> 00:20:54.920
Urd!

00:20:54.920 --> 00:20:57.520
If I were to love her...

00:20:57.520 --> 00:21:01.320
my soul would be pulled over
to its demonic side.

00:21:04.830 --> 00:21:08.360
And so this conflicts with
my pride as a goddess!

00:21:08.360 --> 00:21:10.030
There is absolutely no way I'll say it!

00:21:10.030 --> 00:21:11.290
Fine.

00:21:12.900 --> 00:21:15.530
The favor's on me then.

00:21:17.270 --> 00:21:22.140
You silly girl. Too bad you had to
take after me in this respect.

00:21:29.780 --> 00:21:32.450
Mo...

00:21:32.450 --> 00:21:34.080
Mo... nstrous.

00:21:38.230 --> 00:21:40.750
It looks like I did a bad job bringing you up!

00:21:41.100 --> 00:21:43.260
You didn't bring me up at all!

00:21:46.000 --> 00:21:50.100
Listen, now you owe me one.
And I'll see that you repay me.

00:21:50.370 --> 00:21:52.340
Repay? Why, repay what?

00:21:53.370 --> 00:21:56.070
You think that's going to work with me?

00:22:03.580 --> 00:22:06.380
See you later, Urd.

00:22:14.200 --> 00:22:16.660
Hopefully, that won't be for a long time.

00:22:30.080 --> 00:22:34.850
Whenever one day ends

00:22:34.850 --> 00:22:47.830
"I loved you again today,"
I think quietly in my heart

00:22:47.830 --> 00:22:51.970
When I think back, you see

00:22:51.970 --> 00:22:57.340
There were days when I
wore myself out crying

00:22:57.340 --> 00:23:06.180
But the place we reached after I
survived many such nights

00:23:06.180 --> 00:23:10.590
And the story that began

00:23:10.590 --> 00:23:16.890
Is real in a somehow dreamlike way

00:23:16.890 --> 00:23:25.170
Premonitions of immeasurable love
were certainly overflowing

00:23:25.170 --> 00:23:35.740
From our clasped hands even as we
laughed bashfully a little

00:23:35.740 --> 00:23:45.220
After all, beyond a doubt,
undeniably, you and I

00:23:45.220 --> 00:23:50.250
Are in love with each other

00:23:55.660 --> 00:23:58.700
You goddesses are interfering with me
increasing our demonic share!

00:23:58.700 --> 00:24:01.340
So thinking, she sets them up
with an old-fashioned lamp.

00:24:01.340 --> 00:24:02.670
What manner of powers could it have?

00:24:02.670 --> 00:24:04.740
Next time, "Ah! Do Demons Have Any Dignity?!"

00:24:04.740 --> 00:24:05.110
Ah! Do Demons Have Any Dignity?!
Next time, "Ah! Do Demons Have Any Dignity?!"

00:24:05.110 --> 00:24:06.770
Ah! Do Demons Have Any Dignity?!
Oh, no! How cute!

00:24:06.770 --> 00:24:09.340
Ah! Do Demons Have Any Dignity?!
Your wish is my command! Tee-hee!

00:24:09.340 --> 00:24:09.670
Ah! Do Demons Have Any Dignity?!
